#: b7c8829b65fd4074a1e1ef738050f79d
msgid "应用逐元素的 Shifted SoftPlus (SSP) 激活函数。"
msgstr "Applies the element-wise Shifted SoftPlus (SSP) activation function."

#: 8fdd32f266cb4c79a67391d7a4b2dab2
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"SSP 的计算公式为: "
":math:`\\text{SSP}(x)=\\text{Softplus}(x)-\\text{Softplus}(0)`。 这确保了 "
":math:`\\text{SSP}(0)=0`。"
msgstr ""
"The SSP is computed as: "
":math:`\\text{SSP}(x)=\\text{Softplus}(x)-\\text{Softplus}(0)`. This ensures that "
":math:`\\text{SSP}(0)=0`."

#: b7183f80adf54d33afad7f1d96324939
msgid "Softplus 公式中的 :math:`\\beta` 值。默认为 1。"
msgstr "The :math:`\\beta` value in the Softplus formula. Defaults to 1."

#: c61531978d22415c9e2cdae2a06b6a5e
msgid "当输入值高于此阈值时，Softplus 将退化为线性函数。默认为 20。"
msgstr "When the input value is higher than this threshold, Softplus will degenerate into a linear function. Defaults to 20."

#: 8f71f7b0de444b2488c1702f751b25df
msgid "Shape:"
msgstr "Shape:"

#: 6fd7a52684e94309a500ee6b09bbca9d
msgid "输入: :math:`(N, *)`，其中 `*` 表示任意数量的附加维度。"
msgstr "Input: :math:`(N, *)`, where `*` means any number of additional dimensions."

#: 068bd00a80b940f086835458367f7db1
msgid "输出: :math:`(N, *)`，形状与输入相同。"
msgstr "Output: :math:`(N, *)`, same shape as input."

#: 08cef0ad3bdc4bf08815230870d064d0 6f5edae6491248c49fdb1b017effc389
#: 82c353d6afd14db084452d011fd15bf3 dc51a212e3474b349ad8133b6adfe475
#: f405fe719944451abd1e0b6ef3171e46 f4f3593235634f6ab025e926136860c8
msgid "Define the computation performed at every call."
msgstr "Define the computation performed at every call."

#: 16ef1bb064c843509e06a65ccdf3689d 1765bab92428426685c2ce864e1c1699
#: 1f0313352b5140c19d28091ed2b5ce55 5af5eb83213a46649018094feca3d73f
#: 63a729408f65484bbb5552bfbe123619 7ded8afb714447bfacb64bba2943a479
msgid "Should be overridden by all subclasses."
msgstr "Should be overridden by all subclasses."

#: 41d097389811416990d1403f70db2300 45e06ce10fe6441183c15f0ca119ffc9
#: 5c8b29cb99cb4a7b9c2122182b40af53 62a207e62fa74a83a0c2c0dad9d84abf
#: c0541a4e2b6349b0a47e1ad05fb8c3dd f0d3ace05a9247e3bb1a4d49ea5a950c
msgid ""
"Although the recipe for forward pass needs to be defined within this "
"function, one should call the :class:`Module` instance afterwards instead"
" of this since the former takes care of running the registered hooks "
"while the latter silently ignores them."
msgstr ""
"Although the recipe for forward pass needs to be defined within this "
"function, one should call the :class:`Module` instance afterwards instead"
" of this since the former takes care of running the registered hooks "
"while the latter silently ignores them."

#: 6dc3e56249fc48c4ada6daa75d3a3bd9
msgid "Set the extra representation of the module."
msgstr "Set the extra representation of the module."

#: 50556d23339e448e8d5532dc2b48e704
msgid ""
"To print customized extra information, you should re-implement this "
"method in your own modules. Both single-line and multi-line strings are "
"acceptable."
msgstr ""
"To print customized extra information, you should re-implement this "
"method in your own modules. Both single-line and multi-line strings are "
"acceptable."

#: 856e2a054b8146089618a8c3209dc1ee
msgid "SWISH 激活函数模块"
msgstr "SWISH activation function module"

#: d16aab287e7f4e6b9f39908b74a445ea
msgid "根据字符串名称返回对应的激活函数实例。"
msgstr "Returns the corresponding activation function instance based on the string name."

#: 3cce48b877474ff5976c177127d337bd
msgid "激活函数的名称，支持带有参数，如 \"elu(1.0)\"。"
msgstr "The name of the activation function, supports parameters, e.g., \"elu(1.0)\"."

#: a70eebffb5154b7ca865ff692e06b2dd
msgid "激活函数模块的实例。"
msgstr "An instance of the activation function module."

#: 59f19b6c954f4bd49b9e57ec73f18d38
msgid "抛出"
msgstr "Raises"

#: aa26aecb90ee47efad4ba7964de232de
msgid "如果输入的名称不被支持。"
msgstr "If the input name is not supported."

#: ffea8b15c22a49d6af372d0271bf6182
msgid "绘制预测值与目标值的散点图。"
msgstr "Plots a scatter plot of predicted vs. target values."

#: db308fb49d3a4de4bd1f68d9a1e799ae
msgid "预测值数组。"
msgstr "Array of predicted values."

#: f5985806e45f414eb96d27fa43616d73
msgid "目标值数组。"
msgstr "Array of target values."

#: 73fe00b800ad46b38b774502d5d7533e
msgid "绘制好的图表对象。"
msgstr "The plotted figure object."

#: 9c5f469b5b68428ba8792c30b599f138
msgid "计算 1 - 余弦相似度的损失函数。"
msgstr "Loss function that calculates 1 - cosine similarity."

#: 6a1627407342498d90d47af2aad18941
msgid "计算预测值总和的 L2 范数，用于约束总和为零。"
msgstr "Calculates the L2 norm of the sum of predicted values, used to constrain the sum to zero."

#: 5db20da6436f425a9714064f1f4f5af9
msgid "计算预测值和目标值之间的平均欧几里得距离。"
msgstr "Calculates the average Euclidean distance between predicted and target values."

#: 88ea09d9412242d28ef86d340684d3fe
msgid "均方根误差损失。"
msgstr "Root Mean Squared Error loss."

#: b3c70b55517d454eb212aa66a081d198
msgid "解析配置文件中的度量函数列表，将字符串名称转换为函数实例。"
msgstr "Parses the list of metric functions in the configuration file, converting string names to function instances."

#: 1c95e1058aae48d485342d1ca7f76665
msgid "包含度量函数配置的列表。"
msgstr "A list containing the metric function configurations."

#: e2fad051ba704bd99d2b7c5423563c82
msgid "更新后的列表，其中 'metric' 的值被替换为函数实例。"
msgstr "The updated list, where the value of 'metric' is replaced with a function instance."

#: 141a735e36df432697b165e8c0f4f844
msgid "根据配置文件提取并组织用于日志记录的超参数字典。"
msgstr "Extracts and organizes a dictionary of hyperparameters for logging based on the configuration file."

#: 45982efc54924d859be2366cff2b2965
msgid "项目的全局配置对象。"
msgstr "The project's global configuration object."

#: f64c988e9056449cb49900e23b4ba512
msgid "包含 GNN 名称和相关超参数的字典。"
msgstr "A dictionary containing the GNN name and related hyperparameters."

#: 3a1198ca346f45669f872933a7295b07
msgid "计算图中的所有三元组 (i, j, k)，其中 j 是中心原子。"
msgstr "Computes all triplets (i, j, k) in the a graph, where j is the central atom."

#: e0c5d865e8224292bfbcd8bd3645be22
msgid "边索引，形状为 [2, N_edges]。"
msgstr "Edge index, with shape [2, N_edges]."

#: e4d3cb7cbdaa4389906886a145419f8a
msgid "边的周期性偏移向量。"
msgstr "Periodic offset vector of the edges."

#: 5878da3a28034cca805da16f156d3f81
msgid "每个节点的近邻数量。"
msgstr "Number of neighbors for each node."

#: a59c29af662c461babb8105d986161b9
msgid "包含三元组信息的元组 (col_i, row_j, idx_i, idx_j, idx_k, idx_kj, idx_ji)。"
msgstr "A tuple containing triplet information (col_i, row_j, idx_i, idx_j, idx_k, idx_kj, idx_ji)."
